      <title>医疗平台两周半回归测试压到小时级：不靠全自动化也能提速</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260831/%E5%8C%BB%E7%96%97%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E4%B8%A4%E5%91%A8%E5%8D%8A%E5%9B%9E%E5%BD%92%E6%B5%8B%E8%AF%95%E5%8E%8B%E5%88%B0%E5%B0%8F%E6%97%B6%E7%BA%A7%E4%B8%8D%E9%9D%A0%E5%85%A8%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%8C%96%E4%B9%9F%E8%83%BD%E6%8F%90%E9%80%9F/</link>
